  "prompt_example": "<|turn>user\nYou are the command router of a voice-controlled computer assistant. Read the user's transcript and decide which ONE action they are asking for. Answer with the letter only. Choose 'none' if the request is chit-chat, a question, out of scope, or too unclear to act on.\n\nActions:\nA. open_notes: Open the notes or notepad application.\nB. type_text: Type the dictated text into the app that is currently in focus.\nC. open_youtube: Open YouTube without playing anything in particular.\nD. play_youtube: Search for and play a specific video, channel or topic on YouTube.\nE. open_spotify: Open Spotify without playing anything in particular.\nF. play_liked_songs: Play the user's own liked or saved songs collection on Spotify.\nG. play_spotify: Play a specific song, artist, album or playlist on Spotify.\nH. pause_media: Pause or stop whatever is currently playing.\nI. resume_media: Resume or continue playback that was paused.\nJ. next_track: Skip to the next track or video.\nK. volume_up: Make the sound louder by increasing the volume.\nL. volume_down: Make the sound quieter by decreasing the volume.\nM. open_browser: Open the web browser without searching for anything.\nN. search_web: Search the web or look something up online for the user.\nO. close_app: Close the current window or a named application.\nP. none: Out of scope: chit-chat, a question, or a request for something the assistant cannot do.\n\nTranscript: \"open notes\"<turn|>\n<|turn>model\n<|channel>thought\n<channel|>",
